### Orchestrator Manual Test Requests
# Use the REST Client extension in VS Code to run these.
# Replace {{sandboxId}} with an active E2B sandbox ID.
# Replace {{previewUrl}} with the sandbox URL provided by the server.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionId = {{sessionId}}

### 1. List All Active Sessions (Server API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Create a New Session (Server API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Send Task to CLI (via Server)
# This uses the server's /sessions/:id/task endpoint, which now runs the CLI directly
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/task
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task": "Create a simple landing page with a blue header saying 'Hello World' and a centered button."
}

### 4. Check Session Status (Server API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/exists
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Deploy to Cloudflare (Server API)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/deploy
Content-Type: application/json
